        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Roho wa loli na wa tee",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakundwa, msakeirumiria kula Roho, ela muritime-time iro roho, mpate kuwona ngera ni ra Mlungu; angu walodi wa tee wengi wafumirikie, na kuwoneka wurumwengunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo muchammanya Roho wa Mlungu kwa chia ihi: kula roho irumiriagha angu Jesu Kristo orechieghe ukawuya mdamu, ni ya Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kula roho isemrumiriagha Jesu si ya Mlungu anduangi. Iyo ni roho ya M'maiza wa Kristo, iyo moresikireghe angu iacha, na idana eko wurumwengunyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanake watini, inyo mo wa Mlungu, nenyo mwawisimie awo walodi wa tee, angu uo Roho uko andenyi konyu, ni m'baa kuchumba uo roho uko wurumwengunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ni wa wurumwengu, na agho wighoragha ni gha wurumwengu, na wurumwengu ghwadawisikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isi de wa Mlungu. Uo ose ummanyagha Mlungu wadadisikira; na uo useko wa Mlungu ndeudisikiragha. Kwa chia ihi dammanya uo Roho wa loli, na uo roho wa tee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ni lukundo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakundwa, dikundane diweni na diweni, angu lukundo lwafuma kwa Mlungu; na uo uko na lukundo oovalwa ni Mlungu nao wamwichi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo usene lukundo, ndemwichi Mlungu, angu Mlungu ni lukundo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa chia ihi, lukundo lwa Mlungu lorewonekieghe worinyi aghadi kodu; kukaia, Mlungu oremdumieghe Mwana wake wa ititi wurumwengunyi, eri dipate kukaia moyo kwa chia yake uo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulu nilo lukundo, si angu wei deremkundieghe Mlungu, ela uo nuo oredikundieghe, hata ukamduma Mwana wake upate kukaia wushano kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a redu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakundwa, ikakaia Mlungu oredikundieghe huwo, yadifwana na isi dikundane diweni na diweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie mndungi ummbonie Mlungu jingi; dikakundana diweni na diweni, Mlungu uchakaia andenyi kodu, na lukundo lwake luchakatia andenyi kodu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh. 1.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanya angu isi deko andenyi ya Mlungu, nao moni oko andenyi kodu; kwa kukaia wadinekie Roho wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi dawonie, sena dashuhudia, angu uja Aba oremdumieghe Mwana wake ukaie Mkiri wa wurumwengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo ose urumiriagha kukaia Jesu ni Mwana wa Mlungu, Mlungu wadakaia andenyi kwake, na uo wadakaia andenyi ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho daichi na kurumiria ulo lukundo Mlungu udikunde nalo. Mlungu ni lukundo, na uo ukaiagha andenyi ya lukundo, wadakaia andenyi ya Mlungu, na Mlungu wadakaia andenyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa ilagho iji, ulo lukundo lwa Mlungu lwakatishwa andenyi kodu, eri dipate kukaia na wuwana ijo Ituku ja Kutanywa; angu sa iji koni Kristo uko, niko koni na isi dikaiagha wurumwengunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andu lukundo luko, wowa ndeghuko; ela lukundo lukatie lwadainja wowa. Mundu uko na wowa, ndewadie lukundo lukate, angu adhabu yadaobolwa; na uo uobuagha, ndekatie kwa lukundo anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deko na lukundo, angu Mlungu orezoeghe ukadikunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi ukaghamba “Namkunde Mlungu,” nao uazamilwa ni mruna, mundu uo ni mtee. Angu uo uzamilwagha ni mruna ummbonagha, ndedimagha kumkunda Mlungu usemmbonagha anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi dawadie momu ughu ghufumagha kwake, kukaia uo umkundagha Mlungu, yamfwana umkunde na mruna wori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
